    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Bridge backend data to posts collections. Posts Bridge handles posts collections as indexes that represents your backend data and allows the use of Gutenberg, the powerful page builder of WordPress, as your backend frontend builder.</p>\n<h3>Addons</h3>\n<p>Posts Bridge has core support for REST API connexions and addons for <a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Odoo</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.wordpress.org/rest-api/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WordPress REST API</a> and <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/products/sheets/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google Spreadsheets</a>.</p>\n<h3>Docs</h3>\n<p>See the official plugin&#8217;s documentation on our <a href=\"https://git.coopdevs.org/codeccoop/wp/plugins/posts-bridge/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">gitlab repository</a>.</p>\n"
    },
